# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Career Dashboard — server environment variables
#
# The app boots without these, but AI features (import parsing, fit
# scoring, Coach, cover letters, etc.) need GROQ_API_KEY. There is no
# per-user/BYOK model — every visitor's AI calls run on this one key.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Required for AI features: get a free key at console.groq.com
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...

# Optional: Turso cloud DB for production deployment
# Without these, the app uses a local SQLite file at data/career.db
# Get after: turso db create career-dashboard && turso db tokens create career-dashboard
# TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://career-dashboard-<your-org>.turso.io
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=eyJ...
